      "en": "God will likewise destroy you forever. He will take you up, and pluck you out of your tent, and root you out of the land of the living. Selah.",
      "ko": "그런즉 하나님이 영영히 너를 멸하심이여 너를 취하여 네 장막에서 뽑아내며 생존하는 땅에서 네 뿌리를 빼시리로다(셀라)",
      "source_text_hash": "62cdc2de71e0283335d898a946f9c666395836d179b7db6b8cbb78460736f376",
      "translation_text_hash": "a61abdd3e7696f24695a0d5cb5f61517d7f10127bcb73e4f72b5a97889d71295",
