      "en": "The righteous also will see it, and fear, and laugh at him, saying,",
      "ko": "의인이 보고 두려워하며 또 저를 비웃어 말하기를",
      "source_text_hash": "a92a82bbc178b4e48388bc1357f116c05a51a6f8fbf3c615c7edad8252db8ea6",
      "translation_text_hash": "d6b0633d2ac2d9cb668285ccd5f1ca4d98aa8bd3b09e3f6431a4fb841f7ec67e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "의인이 보고 두려워하며 또 저를 비웃어 말하기를"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d6b0633d2ac2d9cb668285ccd5f1ca4d98aa8bd3b09e3f6431a4fb841f7ec67e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:52:7",
      "sequence": 14718,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 52",
      "verse_label": "7",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
